{"title":"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c76fe07551f173abafb27b056516575c844fe847.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma(k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> be the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a9990a3c3de80c97942a2650fe0b35d91d58636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma(1234) = 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"230\" height=\"18\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/00417c4f30e3366ce0cbb4ba69c4a3b76affca67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma(4) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/8/ac897095fb10e9436e03a4c854d98fd91c83fba9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 20162016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"17\" /> and define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47f916c52f78dee6aa14b60b333e16dd998842d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1} = \\sigma(a_n), n = 1, 2, 3,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"218\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/5/0d5d34d49a7eb6afd4874d7bdaf23946dbf63cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can plug in the function 4 times. We get that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/9/c19c6af274ac7a327d6673d413e35803ebd08cf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = 2+0+1+6+2+0+1+6 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"314\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51ac8e4d483219a5ca38ec768d47bf14714b9a84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3 = 1+8 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/3/643c911b8fbf04884b763fce5f9bb346059b87f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d3762b8466cc37d838ee455871e2e80d24aaf37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_5 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/4/ba4102995dbeddf2b08bfa05d22de7667b05ab8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"21\" height=\"24\" />\n-andliu766\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2016 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/